## Summer at a glance

kpi Books logged | 8,325 | 6.7 per reader | good

kpi Registered | 1,248 | children and teens
kpi Finished | 683 | 54.7% | good
kpi Closing party | 310 | 2026-09-12

Thank you to every reader who joined us this summer. More than half of the 1,248 children and teens who signed up finished the program, and together they logged 8,325 books.

## Books logged by month

chart bar months y=books focus="Jul" labels title="Books logged per month"

July was the busiest month, with 3,115 books logged.

## Readers by age group

chart hbar ages labels title="Registered readers by age group"

Readers aged 8 to 12 were the largest group, with 561 registered.

See you next summer!
